; ============================================================================
;  Gunslinger multi-scope port (stage 1: ak74).
;  - Scope ADDON ITEMS (class WP_SCOPE): the pickable/attachable inventory objects.
;  - Per-weapon SCOPE SECTIONS [scope_*_ak74m]: bones + GS aim offsets + zoom/lens
;    params. The weapon lists them via `scopes_sect`; the engine matches the attached
;    item (scope_name) to its section and drives bones/offsets/zoom/lens from it.
;  NOTE: all scopes use the 3D PiP lens for now (need_lens_frame). The collimators
;  (cobra/rakurs) will get proper no-PiP red-dot rendering in the next step.
;  Inventory icons temporarily reuse the vanilla scope icon (real icons need the GS
;  icon atlas integrated).
; ============================================================================

